{"4047790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bento Story", "steam_appid": 4047790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sayaka</strong> runs the family bento shop in a small village in Japan. She took it over after her mother passed away nearly two years ago, putting her college studies on hold as a result. Running the bento shop is also her only source of income to support herself and her little sister, Akemi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, she receives an acceptance letter for the scholarship she applied for. She should feel nothing but joy — but instead, she finds herself torn: pursue her education in Tokyo and leave the shop behind, or stay and keep the bento shop running. She has about 30 days to decide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange bento based on customer’s request or freely in sandbox mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable smaller bento parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode with 30+ handcrafted customer requests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable new bento parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied bento boxes and kitchen decoration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture and share pictures of your bento</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sayaka</strong> runs the family bento shop in a small village in Japan. She took it over after her mother passed away nearly two years ago, putting her college studies on hold as a result. Running the bento shop is also her only source of income to support herself and her little sister, Akemi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, she receives an acceptance letter for the scholarship she applied for. She should feel nothing but joy — but instead, she finds herself torn: pursue her education in Tokyo and leave the shop behind, or stay and keep the bento shop running. She has about 30 days to decide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange bento based on customer’s request or freely in sandbox mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable smaller bento parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode with 30+ handcrafted customer requests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable new bento parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied bento boxes and kitchen decoration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture and share pictures of your bento</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Bento Story is a bento-arranging simulator with a warm story about a girl deciding her future while serving customers and sending them off with a lunch box that says more than words.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047790/150fe6069bde6f4517a732accc41318fe32a869f/header.jpg?t=1784877577", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047790/96c21d4c445b432ccee8d6e4d7fd50b7afc8fa44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784877577", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047790/96c21d4c445b432ccee8d6e4d7fd50b7afc8fa44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784877577", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 450 or higher with 1GB Memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and